    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEED THE PIT is an investigative horror game where you must communicate with Spirits of The Forest to find dead bodies  for THE PIT, all while avoiding relentless horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELENTLESS MONSTROSITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every visit to the forest, you'll be pursued by one of six unique monsters acting as your nemesis for the round. Each is designed to dismantle your expectations, being unpredictable and persistent. Their behavior is a mystery- You'll need to take dangerous gambles and pay close attention to discover how they work, and more importantly- how to survive them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/5a93b1e18c88367f4a13538ca91dca81.poster.avif?t=1753637681\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/5a93b1e18c88367f4a13538ca91dca81.webm?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/5a93b1e18c88367f4a13538ca91dca81.mp4?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SPIRITUAL INVESTIGATION - THE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE PIT hungers. To find some flesh to feed him, you'll need to speak to spirits. An especially vengeful soul has turned this into a game... Use various ritual CARDS to ask questions to the spirits.  Some may be friendly... And some want you dead. Follow their instructions or pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/8e7f4a7710d427eb04dab4c36672e070.poster.avif?t=1753637681\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/8e7f4a7710d427eb04dab4c36672e070.webm?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/8e7f4a7710d427eb04dab4c36672e070.mp4?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through these spirits, you'll be able to slowly eliminate spaces on your map where the body won't be found, all until only one space remains- The one where the body you seek lies. You must learn, memorize, and practice. No two investigations are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO E.C.C.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elijah, more properly titled 'THE PIT', yields fantastical abilities. And you've just been invited to join his Chosen Circle. We have a higher purpose to serve. A new world order to execute. For Elijah.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/06f39c06a4e70973b544c5d5a05bf55c.poster.avif?t=1753637681\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/06f39c06a4e70973b544c5d5a05bf55c.webm?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/06f39c06a4e70973b544c5d5a05bf55c.mp4?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In FEED THE PIT, you'll be able to talk with each of the other five members. The decisions you make may yield dangerous consequences. Will you stay with the circle? Or stand against them? Cleanse the world of this society? Or cleanse the world of non-believers? Several endings lie ahead. Pick a side- or die.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEED THE PIT is an investigative horror game where you must communicate with Spirits of The Forest to find dead bodies  for THE PIT, all while avoiding relentless horrors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RELENTLESS MONSTROSITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every visit to the forest, you'll be pursued by one of six unique monsters acting as your nemesis for the round. Each is designed to dismantle your expectations, being unpredictable and persistent. Their behavior is a mystery- You'll need to take dangerous gambles and pay close attention to discover how they work, and more importantly- how to survive them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/5a93b1e18c88367f4a13538ca91dca81.poster.avif?t=1753637681\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/5a93b1e18c88367f4a13538ca91dca81.webm?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/5a93b1e18c88367f4a13538ca91dca81.mp4?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SPIRITUAL INVESTIGATION - THE GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE PIT hungers. To find some flesh to feed him, you'll need to speak to spirits. An especially vengeful soul has turned this into a game... Use various ritual CARDS to ask questions to the spirits.  Some may be friendly... And some want you dead. Follow their instructions or pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/8e7f4a7710d427eb04dab4c36672e070.poster.avif?t=1753637681\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/8e7f4a7710d427eb04dab4c36672e070.webm?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/8e7f4a7710d427eb04dab4c36672e070.mp4?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through these spirits, you'll be able to slowly eliminate spaces on your map where the body won't be found, all until only one space remains- The one where the body you seek lies. You must learn, memorize, and practice. No two investigations are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO E.C.C.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elijah, more properly titled 'THE PIT', yields fantastical abilities. And you've just been invited to join his Chosen Circle. We have a higher purpose to serve. A new world order to execute. For Elijah.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/06f39c06a4e70973b544c5d5a05bf55c.poster.avif?t=1753637681\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/06f39c06a4e70973b544c5d5a05bf55c.webm?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3278290/extras/06f39c06a4e70973b544c5d5a05bf55c.mp4?t=1753637681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In FEED THE PIT, you'll be able to talk with each of the other five members. The decisions you make may yield dangerous consequences. Will you stay with the circle? Or stand against them? Cleanse the world of this society? Or cleanse the world of non-believers? Several endings lie ahead. Pick a side- or die.</p>",
